OL,3,CVictim named in fatal argument over
OL,4,Cright of way
OL,6,FA man has appeared in court accused of
OL,7,Fmanslaughter after his dog fatally bit
OL,8,Fa man on a footpath in Wakefield
OL,9,Fduring an argument about a right of
OL,10,Fway.
OL,12,FEmergency services were called to
OL,13,Freports of an altercation on a
OL,14,Ffootpath off Blacker Lane in the
OL,15,FCalder Grove area of Wakefield on the
OL,16,Fafternoon of Saturday 15 August.
OL,18,FJames Judge, 55, was bitten by a dog
OL,19,Fand later died in hospital.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G1/4
