OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F331A1787057313
OL,3,CVictim named in fatal argument over
OL,4,Cright of way
OL,6,FFifty-five-year-old Lee Ellis, of
OL,7,FCalder Grove in Wakefield, has been
OL,8,Fcharged with manslaughter and being in
OL,9,Fcharge of a dog dangerously out of
OL,10,Fcontrol causing injury resulting in
OL,11,Fdeath.
OL,13,FEllis was not asked to enter a plea to
OL,14,Fthe charges at Bradford Magistrates'
OL,15,FCourt this morning.
OL,17,FThe court heard from Rob Fones,
OL,18,Frepresenting Ellis, who said there was
OL,19,F"a verbal altercation in regards to
OL,20,Fright of way".
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G2/4
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,332,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F331A1787057313
OL,3,CVictim named in fatal argument over
OL,4,Cright of way
OL,6,FProsecutor Georgina Fishwick told the
OL,7,Fcourt that an initial post-mortem had
OL,8,Fbeen unable to determine the exact
OL,9,Fnumber of dog bites to Mr Judge.
OL,11,FDistrict Judge Mark Daley put Ellis on
OL,12,Fconditional bail until his next
OL,13,Fappearance at Leeds Crown Court on
OL,14,FSeptember 16.
OL,16,FWearing a grey sweatshirt and
OL,17,Ftracksuit bottoms in court, Ellis
OL,18,Fwiped his eyes and nose with a tissue
OL,19,Fduring the hearing.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G3/4
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
