CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F331A1787057313
OL,3,CVictim named in fatal argument over
OL,4,Cright of way
OL,6,FShortly after Saturday's incident,
OL,7,Fpolice seized a German Shepherd dog
OL,8,Fwhich was is being held in police
OL,9,Fkennels.
OL,11,FThe victim's family are being
OL,12,Fsupported by specialist officers.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G4/4
